PDO_MYSQL for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module pdo_mysql of
php83-pdo_mysql, the same build, with php83-mysqlnd-openssl instead of
php83-mysqlnd. The same files as php83-pdo_mysql: install one of the
two.

The module pdo_mysql of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20230831/pdo_mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d,
its headers in include/php83/php/ext/pdo_mysql.
